15:0 error[E0502]: #define with value 'BUFFER_SIZE' is not allowed. Use 'const' instead: const u32 BUFFER_SIZE <- value;
       help: A `#define` has no type and no scope, so the compiler cannot check its use (ADR-037); a `const` has both.
16:0 error[E0501]: Function-like macro 'MAX' is not allowed. Use inline functions instead.
       help: A macro is textual substitution, so its arguments are evaluated wherever they appear and its operators bind by text (ADR-037); write an `inline` function instead.
